{
    "background_story": "Smiles was a charming and cunning villain in the land of Florin. He was known for his elaborate schemes and clever disguises, often leaving his enemies bewildered and frustrated. Smiles was particularly infamous for his role in the kidnapping of Princess Buttercup, the beautiful and kind-hearted ruler of Florin. With the help of his cohorts, Count Rugen and the Prince, Smiles devised a plan to start a war between Florin and the neighboring kingdom of Guilder. But Smiles' true intentions were soon discovered by the brave Westley, a poor farm boy turned pirate, who thwarted his plans and rescued the princess. Smiles' name became synonymous with evil and deception, earning him a place in the annals of Florin's history as one of the most notorious villains of all time.",
